-musk-x-twitter-ibm-1235615481/ |access-date=November 23, 2023 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=November 18, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231118051012/https://deadline.com/2023/11/elon-musk-x-twitter-ibm-1235615481/ |url-status=live |ref=none}}|{{Cite news |last=Samuels |first=Ben |date=November 17, 2023 |title=Elon Musk and Tucker Carlson Lead Explosion of White Nationalist Antisemitism Since Start of Israel-Gaza War |language=en |work=Haaretz |url=https://www.haaretz.com/us-news/2023-11-17/ty-article/.premium/elon-musk-and-tucker-carlson-are-only-the-tip-of-the-antisemitic-iceberg-amid-gaza-war/0000018b-dd2d-d168-a3ef-ddff1ce20000 |access-date=November 23, 2023 |archive-date=November 19, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231119140253/https://www.haaretz.com/us-news/2023-11-17/ty-article/.premium/elon-musk-and-tucker-carlson-are-only-the-tip-of-the-antisemitic-iceberg-amid-gaza-war/0000018b-dd2d-d168-a3ef-ddff1ce20000 |url-status=live |ref=none}}
}}</ref><ref name="Derbyshire-2025">{{cite news |last1=Derbyshire |first1=Victoria |last2=Whannel |first2=Kate |date=January 7, 2025 |title=Elon Musk's 'disinformation' endangering me, says Jess Phillips |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cn7r0pzz57vo |access-date=January 15, 2025 |publisher=[[BBC News]] }}</ref> While describing himself as a "pro-Semite",<ref name="CNBC160523">{{Cite news |last=Calia |first=Mike |date=May 16, 2023 |title=Elon Musk: 'I'll say what I want, and if the consequence of that is losing money, so be it' |url=https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/16/elon-musk-defends-inflammatory-tweets-ill-say-what-i-want.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230517101337/https://www.cnbc.com/2023/05/16/elon-musk-defends-inflammatory-tweets-ill-say-what-i-want.html |archive-date=May 17, 2023 |access-date=May 17, 2023 |publisher=CNBC}}</ref> his comments regarding [[George Soros]] and [[Jewish communities]] have been condemned by the [[Anti-Defamation League]] and the [[White House]].<ref name="Condemned">{{multiref2 |1={{Cite news |date=November 18, 2023 |title=White House blasts Musk's 'hideous' antisemitic lie, advertisers pause on X |language=en |publisher=Reuters |url=https://www.reuters.com/world/white-house-condemns-musk-spreading-hideous-antisemitic-lies-2023-11-17/ |access-date=November 23, 2023 |archive-date=November 17, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231117162311/https://www.reuters.com/world/white-house-condemns-musk-spreading-hideous-antisemitic-lies-2023-11-17/ |url-status=live}} |2={{Cite news |last=Wendling |first=Mike |date=November 17, 2023 |title=White House criticises Elon Musk over 'hideous' antisemitic lie |language=en-GB |publisher=[[BBC News]] |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/world-us-canada-67446800 |access-date=November 23, 2023 |archive-date=November 18, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231118004746/https://www.bbc.com/news/world-us-canada-67446800 |url-status=live |ref=none}} |3